    {"word":"force","lang":"en","translation":"kuch · сила","definition":"Ta’sir, jism tezlanishini o‘zgartiradi. F = m·a. Сила — причина изменения скорости.","example":"Gravity is a force. Gravitatsiya — kuch.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"mass","lang":"en","translation":"massa · масса","definition":"Jismdagi modda miqdori (kg). Количество вещества в теле.","example":"The mass of the stone is 2 kg.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"weight","lang":"en","translation":"og'irlik · вес","definition":"P = m·g. Og‘irlik — gravitatsiya kuchi. Вес — сила тяжести.","example":"Weight is less on the Moon.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"velocity","lang":"en","translation":"tezlik (vektor) · скорость","definition":"Yo‘nalishi bor tezlik. Скорость с направлением.","example":"Velocity is 10 m/s east.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"acceleration","lang":"en","translation":"tezlanish · ускорение","definition":"Tezlikning o‘zgarish tezligi (m/s²). Изменение скорости за время.","example":"a = (v − v0) / t","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"gravity","lang":"en","translation":"gravitatsiya · гравитация","definition":"Jismlarning o‘zaro tortishishi. Взаимное притяжение тел.","example":"g ≈ 9.8 m/s²","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"energy","lang":"en","translation":"energiya · энергия","definition":"Ish qilish qobiliyati. Способность совершать работу.","example":"Energy is measured in joules.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"kinetic energy","lang":"en","translation":"kinetik energiya · кинетическая энергия","definition":"Ek = mv² / 2. Harakat energiyasi. Энергия движения.","example":"A moving car has kinetic energy.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"potential energy","lang":"en","translation":"potensial energiya · потенциальная энергия","definition":"Ep = mgh. Holat energiyasi. Энергия положения.","example":"A book on a shelf has potential energy.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"work","lang":"en","translation":"ish · работа","definition":"A = F·s. Kuchning yo‘l bo‘yicha ta’siri. Работа силы.","example":"Work is measured in joules.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"power","lang":"en","translation":"quvvat · мощность","definition":"N = A / t (watt). Ishning bajarilish tezligi.","example":"A 60 W lamp.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"pressure","lang":"en","translation":"bosim · давление","definition":"p = F / S (pascal). Kuchning yuzaga ta’siri.","example":"Air pressure is about 100 kPa.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"density","lang":"en","translation":"zichlik · плотность","definition":"ρ = m / V. Massaning hajmga nisbati.","example":"Water density is 1000 kg/m³.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"friction","lang":"en","translation":"ishqalanish · трение","definition":"Sirpanishga qarshi kuch. Сила, мешающая скольжению.","example":"Friction heats the hands.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"inertia","lang":"en","translation":"inersiya · инерция","definition":"Jism holatini saqlash xossasi. Свойство сохранять скорость.","example":"Newton's first law is about inertia.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"momentum","lang":"en","translation":"impuls · импульс","definition":"p = m·v. Harakat miqdori.","example":"Momentum is conserved in collisions.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"electric current","lang":"en","translation":"elektr toki · электрический ток","definition":"Zaryadlarning yo‘nalgan harakati (amper).","example":"Current flows in a closed circuit.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"voltage","lang":"en","translation":"kuchlanish · напряжение","definition":"U (volt). Potensiallar farqi.","example":"The battery voltage is 12 V.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"resistance","lang":"en","translation":"qarshilik · сопротивление","definition":"R (ohm). Tokka qarshilik.","example":"Ohm's law: I = U / R","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"Ohm's law","lang":"en","translation":"Om qonuni · закон Ома","definition":"I = U / R. Tok kuchlanishga to‘g‘ri, qarshilikka teskari.","example":"If U=6 V and R=2 Ω, I=3 A.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"circuit","lang":"en","translation":"elektr zanjiri · электрическая цепь","definition":"Tok o‘tadigan yopiq yo‘l. Замкнутый путь тока.","example":"A circuit has a source, wires and a lamp.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"magnet","lang":"en","translation":"magnit · магнит","definition":"Temirni tortadigan jism. Тело с магнитным полем.","example":"A magnet has north and south poles.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"wave","lang":"en","translation":"to'lqin · волна","definition":"Tebranishning fazoda tarqalishi. Распространение колебаний.","example":"Sound is a wave. Tovush — to‘lqin.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"frequency","lang":"en","translation":"chastota · частота","definition":"f = 1 / T (hertz). Bir sekunddagi tebranishlar soni.","example":"The frequency of sound is 440 Hz.","subject":"physics"},
    {"word":"atom","lang":"en","translation":"atom · атом","definition":"Moddaning eng kichik zarrasi. Мельчайшая частица элемента.","example":"An atom has a nucleus and electrons.","subject":"physics"},
