    {"word":"chemical reaction","lang":"en","translation":"kimyoviy reaksiya · химическая реакция","definition":"Moddalarning yangi moddalarga aylanishi.","example":"2H2 + O2 → 2H2O","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"acid","lang":"en","translation":"kislota · кислота","definition":"H+ beradigan modda, pH < 7. Вещество с кислыми свойствами.","example":"HCl is an acid.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"base","lang":"en","translation":"asos · основание","definition":"OH− beradigan modda, pH > 7. Щёлочь/основание.","example":"NaOH is a base.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"salt","lang":"en","translation":"tuz · соль","definition":"Kislota va asos reaksiyasi mahsuli. Продукт нейтрализации.","example":"NaCl is table salt.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"oxide","lang":"en","translation":"oksid · оксид","definition":"Elementning kislorod bilan birikmasi.","example":"CO2 is carbon dioxide.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"solution","lang":"en","translation":"eritma · раствор","definition":"Erituvchi + erigan modda. Растворённое вещество в растворителе.","example":"Sugar in water is a solution.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"ion","lang":"en","translation":"ion · ион","definition":"Zaryadlangan zarra. Заряженная частица.","example":"Na+ and Cl− in salt solution.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"pH","lang":"en","translation":"pH · водородный показатель","definition":"Muhitning kislotalilik o‘lchovi (0–14).","example":"pH 7 is neutral.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"catalyst","lang":"en","translation":"katalizator · катализатор","definition":"Reaksiyani tezlashtiradi, o‘zi sarflanmaydi.","example":"Enzymes are biological catalysts.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"mole","lang":"en","translation":"mol · моль","definition":"6.02×10²³ zarra. Количество вещества.","example":"1 mole of water is 18 g.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"periodic table","lang":"en","translation":"davriy jadval · периодическая таблица","definition":"Mendeleyev jadvali. Элементы по атомному номеру.","example":"H is number 1 in the table.","subject":"chemistry"},
    {"word":"valence","lang":"en","translation":"valentlik · валентность","definition":"Atomning bog‘lar soni. Число химических связей.","example":"Carbon often has valence 4.","subject":"chemistry"},

